{"3893580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shooting Girls", "steam_appid": 3893580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.poster.avif?t=1786431089\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.webm?t=1786431089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.mp4?t=1786431089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Thrilling real-time shooting battles with cute girls!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting Girls is a real-time bullet hell PvP shooting game that anyone can enjoy with simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up but hard to master, quick reactions and sharp decision-making will decide the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your own playstyle with a variety of characters and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/e3ab4a3f38a999f7ccd4093be3666652.avif?t=1786431089\" width=1152 height=1400 /></span>■ Charming and Unique Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls with different backgrounds and abilities face off in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from ranged, melee, and special abilities to match your preferred playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/c876f7567fcf077c600a36407adc6b09.avif?t=1786431089\" width=1560 height=874 /></span>■ Multiple Battle Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 1v1 duels, 2v2 team battles, or survive to the end in Battle Royale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/78d344932ec83cf0ff8221d8f10c8dfb.avif?t=1786431089\" width=1560 height=1104 /></span>■ Items That Hold the Key to Victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items that appear during battle to change the course of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/4403527cf45ef2ab7339e6a953ac7319.avif?t=1786431089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras_big/4403527cf45ef2ab7339e6a953ac7319.avif?t=1786431089 width=1560 height=668 /></span>■ Variety of Skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From swimsuits to casual wear and sports outfits, customize your style for the battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.poster.avif?t=1786431089\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.webm?t=1786431089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893580/extras/ff4410e89169095c26fed1492e8b287d.mp4?t=1786431089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Thrilling real-time shooting battles with cute girls!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting Girls is a real-time bullet hell PvP shooting game that an